{
  "$schema": "../../specs/erc7730-v2.schema.json",
  "_curation_note": "PQSigner semantic curation: all six sAVAX routes are admitted only for the fixed-block Avalanche proxy below. submit shows the exact native AVAX paid while stating that minted sAVAX uses the live pool rate and has no signed minimum. requestUnlock shows the exact sAVAX placed into custody while stating that later AVAX is state-derived. The four redemption routes identify the selected request scope and distinguish AVAX claims from overdue sAVAX returns; their amounts come from caller-bound request and exchange-rate state. Evidence pins the EIP-1967 implementation, proxy/implementation runtimes, Routescan-verified source/ABI, token metadata, and cooldown/redeem periods. It is historical authority, not live pool rate, request state, balance, pause/cap state, execution success, future proxy upgrades, fallback, or blind-signing authority.",
